{"4154250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Roads: 4×4 Off-Road Challenge", "steam_appid": 4154250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/extras/66c832dd95f77c617a264b403a63acaf.avif?t=1783016048\" width=1024 height=226 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚙 FIND YOUR OWN WAY THROUGH THE WILDERNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Roads: 4×4 Off-Road Challenge is an off-road route-finding game where the challenge is not following the trail — it’s figuring out your own path through rough terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your 4x4 across forests, rivers, mud, rocks, steep hills, and open wilderness while trying to reach the destination using the smartest route possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A straight line might save time…<br>but the terrain may not let you survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/extras/590768e8594d2a1024df9b5f2a407596.avif?t=1783016048\" width=1024 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 THE ROUTE IS THE CHALLENGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no forced roads.<br>No single correct path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 Push through dense forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛰️ Risk steep climbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Attempt river crossings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 Crawl across dangerous rock terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚙 Search for smoother routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📏 Cut distance wherever possible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision affects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Your completion time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📏 Distance traveled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Vehicle stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 Momentum and traction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shortest route is rarely the safest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/extras/ed40a7eb5882bd6728f553f5968aaa92.avif?t=1783016048\" width=1024 height=230 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 Distance Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about reaching the destination.<br>It’s about finding the smartest way there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can compete for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shortest distance traveled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fastest completion time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >most efficient route</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the dangerous path is worth it.<br>Sometimes it isn’t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Designed For Players Who Enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off-road traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountain driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain problem solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration through difficult terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I think I can make it up there” gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚙 No Roads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mountain traversal adventure where the terrain decides whether your route was a good idea.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/extras/66c832dd95f77c617a264b403a63acaf.avif?t=1783016048\" width=1024 height=226 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚙 FIND YOUR OWN WAY THROUGH THE WILDERNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Roads: 4×4 Off-Road Challenge is an off-road route-finding game where the challenge is not following the trail — it’s figuring out your own path through rough terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your 4x4 across forests, rivers, mud, rocks, steep hills, and open wilderness while trying to reach the destination using the smartest route possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A straight line might save time…<br>but the terrain may not let you survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/extras/590768e8594d2a1024df9b5f2a407596.avif?t=1783016048\" width=1024 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 THE ROUTE IS THE CHALLENGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no forced roads.<br>No single correct path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 Push through dense forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛰️ Risk steep climbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Attempt river crossings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 Crawl across dangerous rock terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚙 Search for smoother routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📏 Cut distance wherever possible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision affects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Your completion time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📏 Distance traveled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Vehicle stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 Momentum and traction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shortest route is rarely the safest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/extras/ed40a7eb5882bd6728f553f5968aaa92.avif?t=1783016048\" width=1024 height=230 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 Distance Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about reaching the destination.<br>It’s about finding the smartest way there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can compete for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shortest distance traveled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fastest completion time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >most efficient route</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the dangerous path is worth it.<br>Sometimes it isn’t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Designed For Players Who Enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off-road traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountain driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain problem solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration through difficult terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I think I can make it up there” gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚙 No Roads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mountain traversal adventure where the terrain decides whether your route was a good idea.</p>", "short_description": "A mountain off-road traversal adventure focused on risky shortcuts, dangerous terrain, and finding your own route to the destination.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/4cf8bb1849d682cc2dfc66c05b3e697c73c1c785/header.jpg?t=1783016048", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/9cab686ceb6fc8d1360204bc25e815f45812d8f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783016048", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154250/9cab686ceb6fc8d1360204bc25